    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1885\">Uses:</strong> Intelligence modifier per short or long rest (minimum 1).</p><p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2037\">When you cast a Bard spell of 1st level or higher, you can channel extra energy into it:</p><ul data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2223\"><li data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2163\"><p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2163\">Change the damage type of the spell to acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder, <strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2160\">or add a damage type if it lacks one</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2223\"><p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2223\">Add your <strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2200\">Charisma modifier</strong> to the damage dealt.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2368\">If the spell doesn’t normally deal damage, this added damage is applied harmlessly and does not end the spell if damage would normally do so.</p>",
